Here's what's happening:
```
Root Layout (MantineProvider) 
  └── Site Layout (MantineProvider) ← This is causing the conflict!
      └── Dashboard Layout (possibly another MantineProvider?)
```

**Fix: Remove nested MantineProviders**

You should only have **ONE** MantineProvider at the very root level. Here's how to fix it:

## 1. Root Layout (`app/layout.tsx`) - Keep MantineProvider here:
```tsx
export default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {
  return (
    <html lang="en">
      <head>
        <ColorSchemeScript />
      </head>
      <body>
        <MantineProvider>
          {children}
        </MantineProvider>
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

## 2. Site Layout - Remove MantineProvider:
```tsx
