The changes I made are similar to those for the scripts page:

1. Split the component into server and client parts:
   - `page.tsx` - Server component that handles metadata
   - `ServerStatusClient.tsx` - Client component that handles interactivity

2. Removed the AdminLayout import and wrapper since your admin layout is now handled by `app/admin/layout.tsx`

3. Removed the Head component and replaced it with metadata export in the server component

4. Kept all the interactive functionality and UI in the client component

This approach follows Next.js App Router best practices by separating server and client concerns while maintaining all the functionality of your server status page.

